DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppuucc driver provides support for PCI communications cards containing
     simple communications ports, such as NS16550-family (ccoomm) serial ports
     and standard PC-like (llpptt) parallel ports.  The driver is called
     “universal” because the interfaces to these devices aren't nearly as well
     defined and standard as they should be.

